  "description": "Chrissy—Chrysanthemum—Han met the love of her life as she hit rock bottom. Her boyfriend cheated with another woman and, worst of all, she was cute! When the other woman decides to pay off the debt of Chrissy's ex boyfriend, Chrissy can't help but slowly fall for her. Can a love like this last or will she wish she was gone like all the rest?\n(Source: Tapas)",
